<title>SWEDEN: Swedish producer prices rise 0.3 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Swedish producer prices rise 0.3 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish producer prices rose 0.3 percent in January for a year-on-year fall of 2.2 percent, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.  </p>
<p> (Percentage change)		Jan 97	 yr/yr</p>
<p> Export prices			0.5	    -3.6</p>
<p> Import prices			0.7	     0.9</p>
<p> Producer prices		    0.3	    -2.2</p>
<p>Note - The market had expected PPI to rise by 0.3 percent in January, according to a Reuter survey.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
